        "original_id": "42100df1-20c2-5654-a98c-6bd27c762461",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Matheson & Company, Jardine Matheson, Dairy Farm International Holdings\n- Places: London, Hong Kong, Calcutta, Bermuda, Singapore, Asia, Pacific region, China\n- Organizations: Jardine Skinner\n- Systems: Singapore Exchange\n- Products: Jardine Pacific, Jardine Motors, Jardine Lloyd Thompson, Hongkong Land, Jardine Strategic Holdings, Dairy Farm, Mandarin Oriental Hotel Group, Jardine Cycle & Carriage, Astra International\n\nFacts:\n- Matheson & Company was a London-based trading house closely associated with Jardine Matheson of Hong Kong and Jardine Skinner of Calcutta.\n- Jardine Matheson Holdings Limited, also known as Jardines, is a British conglomerate incorporated in Bermuda with its primary listing on the Singapore Exchange.\n- Jardine Matheson has the majority of its business interests in Asia.\n- Jardine Matheson subsidiaries include Jardine Pacific, Jardine Motors, Jardine Lloyd Thompson, Hongkong Land, Jardine Strategic Holdings, Dairy Farm, Mandarin Oriental Hotel Group, Jardine Cycle & Carriage, and Astra International.\n- Dairy Farm International Holdings is a member of the Jardine Matheson Group.\n- Dairy Farm International Holdings is a major pan-Asian retailer involved in the processing and wholesaling of food and personal hygiene products in the Pacific region and in China.",
